        The bug was caused by improper management of the CAN device's memory, specifically the premature freeing of the netdev device in the `m_can_class_register` and `m_can_class_unregister` functions. This could lead to memory leaks if the device was not properly cleaned up during error conditions in the probe process, as the device was allocated and managed by peripheral devices.

